这就是它，一辆米色的奥斯汀公主，配有棕色呆胶车顶。
And here it is,
a beige Austin Princess
with a brown vinyl roof.

1155
00:58:42,300 --> 00:58:43,600
-是啊！  
-是啊！
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

1156
00:58:43,633 --> 00:58:45,800
英国造了好车！
Britain made a good car!

1157
00:58:45,833 --> 00:58:47,867
-是啊！  
-这就是车。
-Yeah!
-That's the car.

1158
00:58:47,900 --> 00:58:50,067
-干得好，詹姆斯。  
-谢谢。
-Well done, James.
-Thank you.

1159
00:58:50,100 --> 00:58:52,033
只有一辆。
There was only one.

1160
00:58:52,067 --> 00:58:53,900
-仅此而已。  
-它们太烂了。
-Just that.
-They were rubbish.

1161
00:58:53,933 --> 00:58:56,667
说到这件劲爆新闻，咱们该收场了。
And on that bombshell,
it is now time to end.

1162
00:58:56,700 --> 00:58:58,367
真是非常感谢大家收看。
Thank you very much
for watching.

1163
00:58:58,400 --> 00:58:59,500
